<title>AUSTRALIA: Just Jeans half yr net down to A$4.63 mln.</title>
<headline>Just Jeans half yr net down to A$4.63 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to January 25.</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     7.16 vs 14.35</p>
<p>    Net					4.63 vs  9.07</p>
<p>    Interim dividend (cents)	   4.0  vs  5.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Just Jeans Holdings Ltd is a clothing retailer. It said on January 7 its pre-tax earnings for the first half year were likely to be 50 percent of those posted in the same half a year earlier.  </p>
<p>    Sales				  170.33 vs  178.43</p>
<p>    Other income			   2.16 vs    0.09</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    5.5  vs   11.0</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			  nil vs  nil</p>
<p>Dividend is fully franked</p>
<p>Pay date May 12</p>
<p>Reg date April 30</p>
<p>    Tax					2.53 vs   5.30</p>
<p>    Interest				 0.83 vs   1.04</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   4.38 vs   4.29</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
